{"componentChunkName":"component---src-layouts-designer-layout-tsx","path":"/designers/grace-loves-lace/","result":{"data":{"strapiDesigner":{"id":"1555a956-4f35-5781-ab40-86d9899059b0","strapi_id":37,"ShortDescription":"Handcrafted in coastal Australia, Grace Loves Lace creates romantic gowns made to move, breathe, and feel like you.\n\n\n","PriceRangeLow":"255000","PriceRangeHigh":"350000","Name":"GRACE LOVES LACE","LongDescription":[{"children":[{"text":"Grace Loves Lace was created from the belief that brides deserve more than the traditional “wedding uniform.” Founder Megan Ziems set out to design gowns that feel as good as they look – pieces you can move, dance, breathe, and be yourself in. "}]},{"children":[{"text":"Since 2010, they’ve championed effortless luxury with handcrafted gowns full of soul and originality. Designed and made in their coastal studio in Burleigh Heads, Australia, Grace Loves Lace has grown from a cult-loved label to a worldwide favorite. "}]},{"children":[{"text":"For the bride who wants modern romance, comfort without compromise, and a look that feels authentically her. "}]},{"children":[{"text":""}]},{"children":[{"text":""}]},{"children":[{"text":""}]}],"ImageDesktop":[{"localFile":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#080808","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/f6f088afaaf3312de51f4b9a20863186/b42f4/graceloveslace_desktop_26c03b315f.jpg","srcSet":"/static/f6f088afaaf3312de51f4b9a20863186/f0f41/graceloveslace_desktop_26c03b315f.jpg 329w,\n/static/f6f088afaaf3312de51f4b9a20863186/9cfda/graceloveslace_desktop_26c03b315f.jpg 659w,\n/static/f6f088afaaf3312de51f4b9a20863186/b42f4/graceloveslace_desktop_26c03b315f.jpg 1317w","sizes":"(min-width: 1317px) 1317px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/f6f088afaaf3312de51f4b9a20863186/3b773/graceloveslace_desktop_26c03b315f.webp 329w,\n/static/f6f088afaaf3312de51f4b9a20863186/ee11f/graceloveslace_desktop_26c03b315f.webp 659w,\n/static/f6f088afaaf33